{
  "comment": "Role -> skill mapping for `cawplan skill update`. Roles come from product members (GET /api/v1/public/openapi/products -> members.<members_key>). A user gets the union of every matched role. `common` is added to every role unless include_common is false. `all: true` means every skill listed by any role. `optional` skills are never installed by role and never pruned. Validated by scripts/validate-skills.sh.",
